        "subject": "LU-19809 utils: avoid reopening regular files as directories",
        "message": "LU-19809 utils: avoid reopening regular files as directories\n\nMDT migration reopens regular files as directories, causing ENOTDIR.\nReopen only directories and skip the directory shrink for files.\n\nReport missing paths and dangling symlinks in traversal, since\nskipping the shrink removes their error diagnostic.  Test these\ncases in sanity/230D.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nFixes: 39fe7d2ef4da (\"LU-7628 lfs: fix NULL pointer check in cb_migrate_mdt_init()\")\nSigned-off-by: Rajeev Mishra <rajeevm@hpe.com>\nChange-Id: I8bdd0cc89c6cc8d32fa74606591c836fa7a9b901\n"
      },
